# -------------------------------------------------
# Example environment file for Aster & Row AI Agent
# -------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` and replace the placeholder
# values with your real API credentials.  Do NOT commit
# the resulting `.env` to version control – it is listed
# in .gitignore for safety.
#
# The agent will look for the following variables:
#   • OPENAI_API_KEY  – API key for OpenAI (e.g. GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini)
#   • GEMINI_API_KEY  – API key for Google Gemini Flash / Pro
#   • GOOGLE_API_KEY  – Older alias for GEMINI_API_KEY (optional)
#
# Only ONE of the above is needed to activate Live LLM Mode.
# If neither is set, the agent runs in deterministic offline mode.
# -------------------------------------------------

# OpenAI – get the key from https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Google Gemini – obtain the key from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

# Optional alias for GEMINI_API_KEY (kept for backward compatibility)
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here
